    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357">

                <pb facs="0523" n="443" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg443"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.114 Reidun/101: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Norway</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Biddle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-03-26T18:00:00-05:00">March 26, 1936—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8. Steamship <hi rendition="#italic">Reidun</hi> seized March 17 under Section
                    586 Tariff Act and 205 Anti-Smuggling Act. Four officers arrested same day
                    charged with conspiracy under Section 88 Title 18 United States Code in
                    connection with seizure smuggling vessel <hi rendition="#italic">Pronto</hi> off
                    South Carolina. Part of <hi rendition="#italic">Reidun</hi> cargo found on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Pronto</hi> and part on wharf at Keansburg, New
                    Jersey.</p>
                <p>The above is for your information as Norwegian Minister is making active
                    representations in the case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
